	(text "CAN BUS (500 kbit/s): one MCP2562 per node, VDD 5 V / Vio 3.3 V, STBY low. 120R only at the LEFT (U5) and RIGHT (U10) ends.\nRoute CANH/CANL as a pair in bus order: U5 (left) - U6 (slot 0) - U7 (slot 1) - U8 (slot 2) - U9 (center) - U10 (right).\nScreens: CAN TX = GPIO34 (header pin 31), CAN RX = GPIO36 (header pin 23). Slots: TX = GPIO32, RX = GPIO33,\nslot ID straps GPIO13 (ID0) / GPIO23 (ID1), grounded = 1: slot 0 open/open, slot 1 ID0, slot 2 ID1."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 215 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "45d2cae5-a885-421d-943d-f1cc09cc57a1")
	)
